      "description": "Portable preview of the incumbent date icon. Production fits native weekday/day glyph contours on the 64-unit plane.",
      "html": "<svg class=\"ds-icon\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"12 ноября\"><defs><clipPath id=\"ds-calendar-clip\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"62\" height=\"62\" rx=\"6\"/></clipPath></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"62\" height=\"62\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FCFCFC\"/><g clip-path=\"url(#ds-calendar-clip)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"64\" height=\"27\" fill=\"#C42B36\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"22\" class=\"ds-icon-weekday\">ЧТ</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"55\" class=\"ds-icon-day\">12</text></g><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"62\" height=\"62\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#D7D7D7\"/></svg>",
      "css": ".ds-icon text{font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-weight:700;text-anchor:middle}.ds-icon-weekday{font-size:27px;fill:#FFFFFF}.ds-icon-day{font-size:41px;fill:#18181B}"
