      "description": "Portable preview of the 32px native gear, with attention dot and visible focus.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-settings\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Настройки\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 3 1-2h4l1 2 2 1 2-.2 2 3-1.2 1.8v2.8L21 13l-2 3-2-.2-2 1-1 2h-4l-1-2-2-1-2 .2-2-3 1.2-1.8V8.4L3 6.8l2-3 2 .2Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-settings-attention\"></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-settings{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;width:32px;height:32px;padding:0;border:0;background:#FAFAFA;color:#202020;cursor:pointer}.ds-settings:hover,.ds-settings:active{background:#E8E8E8}.ds-settings:focus-visible{outline:1px dotted #202020;outline-offset:-3px}.ds-settings-attention{position:absolute;right:3px;top:3px;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:#C42B36}"
