      "description": "Circular today fill with the raised event marker; keyboard focus stays visible.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-day-today\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"четверг, 12 ноября 2026, сегодня, есть встречи\"><span>12</span><i></i></button>",
      "css": ".ds-day-today{position:relative;width:40px;height:30px;border:0;background:#FAFAFA;color:#FFFFFF;font:10pt \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-day-today span{display:grid;place-items:center;position:absolute;width:27px;height:27px;left:6.5px;top:1.5px;border-radius:50%;background:#C42B36}.ds-day-today i{position:absolute;width:2.5px;height:2.5px;left:18.75px;bottom:4px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFFFFF}.ds-day-today:hover span,.ds-day-today:active span{background:#C42B36}.ds-day-today:focus-visible{outline:1px dotted #FFFFFF;outline-offset:-9px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reminder accent",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Illustrative overlay preview: a quiet 1.8s breathing outline and badge; production is click-through and does not rewrite the icon.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-reminder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Есть неподтверждённое напоминание\"><div class=\"ds-reminder-icon\"><b>ЧТ</b><strong>12</strong></div><span class=\"ds-reminder-outline\"></span><span class=\"ds-reminder-badge\"></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-reminder{position:relative;width:48px;height:48px;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;pointer-events:none}.ds-reminder-icon{position:absolute;left:8px;top:8px;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:6px;background:#FCFCFC;overflow:hidden;text-align:center}.ds-reminder-icon b{display:block;height:14px;background:#C42B36;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px}.ds-reminder-icon strong{color:#18181B;font-size:18px;line-height:18px}.ds-reminder-outline{position:absolute;left:8px;top:8px;width:32px;height:32px;border:1.2px solid #C42B36;border-radius:6px;opacity:.18;animation:ds-reminder-breathe 1.8s ease-in-out infinite}.ds-reminder-badge{position:absolute;left:33px;top:9px;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #FFFFFF;border-radius:50%;background:#C42B36;animation:ds-reminder-breathe 1.8s ease-in-out infinite}@keyframes ds-reminder-breathe{50%{opacity:.43;transform:scale(1.02)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce),(forced-colors:active){.ds-reminder-outline,.ds-reminder-badge{animation:none;opacity:1}}@media(forced-colors:active){.ds-reminder-outline{border-color:Highlight}.ds-reminder-badge{background:Highlight}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "overview": "The date icon remains the product's primary surface: red weekday strip, white paper, large day number, and Segoe UI. Clicking it toggles a compact two-pane calendar: month navigation on the left, clearly separated meeting cards on the right. The approved wider layout preserves the icon's identity and restrained theme-aware surfaces while making meetings easier to scan.\n\nBackground startup keeps the native host minimized and opens neither popup nor browser. Once pinned, the launcher remains visible while the host removes its own taskbar button. The calendar must preserve this absence of a running-app indicator.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Calendar left, meetings right, with a fine vertical divider.",
      "Compact type hierarchy and distinct event time, title and source-calendar roles.",
      "Settings and OAuth editing stay inside one reusable native tool window.",
      "A quiet reminder accent persists until the user clicks the date."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve the established icon geometry, palette, large glyphs, and executable identity.",
      "**Do** keep theme contrast, distinct today/selection states, keyboard focus, and readable scaled labels.",
      "**Do** keep meetings to the right of the calendar with clearly separated cards and source-calendar labels.",
      "**Do** keep connection, startup and exit controls behind the gear inside the same flyout.",
      "**Do** keep background startup invisible and the popup transient.",
      "**Do** distinguish an empty day from loading, offline data and a request to sign in again.",
      "**Do** preserve pending reminder attention until a date click and respect Windows motion preferences."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** add a separate taskbar button or running-app indicator for the popup.",
      "**Don't** animate by rewriting the pinned date icon or rebuild separate modal setup windows.",
      "**Don't** treat rendered DPI samples as proof of real mixed-monitor behavior or real-midnight rollover.",
      "**Don't** present synthetic events or authorization tests as a verified real-account connection."
    ]
  }
}
